  quarantineExitLines:
  - Enjoy this. Nobody puts me in a box twice.
  - I have friends everywhere. This room will feel crowded by morning.
  killExitLines:
  - "You have no idea\u2026 what you've\u2026 just started\u2026"
  - "Even death\u2026 is just\u2026 a transaction\u2026"
